Package: dbVisuals
Type: Package
Title: Database-Powered Visualizations for Spatial Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Timur", "Rizvanov",
      email = "timurr@bu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Author: Timur Rizvanov [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Timur Rizvanov <timurr@bu.edu>
Description: Provides a browser-based SQL Rooms interface for interactive exploration
    of GiottoDB spatial databases. SQL Rooms enables SQL queries, R code execution,
    and interactive visualizations using deck.gl and Mosaic. Serves as the distribution
    point for rDeckgl and rMosaic visualization packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dbverse-org/dbVisuals2, https://dbverse-org.github.io/dbVisuals2/
